{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "786735aa2aac97d49511daa05915de16811a1678c177d743091341c6a250645c", "ja": "レコーディングに臨むジュリアと静香だが、\r\nスタイルの違いが表面化して、どうしても\r\n息が合わない。\r\n再レコーディングが決まるものの\r\nふたりの考えはすれ違ったまま。", "zh": "茱莉亚与静香准备进行录音，\n但两人风格的差异终于浮上水面，\n实在难以互相配合。\n虽然决定重新录音，\n然而两人仍旧无法达成共识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "82dd4d85b1ab34ce5aaecabd4ee4d0a4005beace25ba81dbea275530843a9f95", "ja": "（今日は収録スタジオを押さえてのレコーディングだ。\n直前の千早の収録がつつがなく終わって……）", "zh": "（今天预约了录音室要来录音。\n前一个录音的千早顺利结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8b71f2613bcd88395ebca584f0101d359d277b61900679f967ec91a79ac3abfb", "ja": "（次は、ジュリアと静香の番だ。\nふたりとも、頑張れよ……！）", "zh": "（接下来就轮到茱莉亚和静香了。\n你们要加油啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "d6047f5d0d6a54da32c1deaccaaa87070c145b16af48581f73fe2c45289e286c", "ja": "チハ、お疲れ！\n今度の曲もいい感じじゃないか。", "zh": "千，辛苦啦！\n这次的歌也很不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "7bec92469b16dfaf1f9b2016549f380ed19df6ca1dbd4a52025ea976e8fa8e07", "ja": "お疲れさまです、千早さん！", "zh": "辛苦你了，千早！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "65e721577e07a8f8147f8a7e5aef57e0e3a77522adf92cee2e46acfc7e90b5ea", "ja": "ジュリア、それに……静香も。\nお疲れさま。", "zh": "茱莉亚，还有……静香也在。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "98d5988f0c3764b5646c50b4f9401460674a19ac7c209ac60a47832d50ba4025", "ja": "ふたりは、例の新ユニットの収録ね。\nできれば聞いていきたかったけれど……。", "zh": "你们两位是要录制新团体的歌曲吧？\n可以的话，我很希望能留下来听……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "b1893a236765e3dcd7828939d9429c2979bdf371a862263bf0cb79496f283b6d", "ja": "あいにく次の仕事まで時間がなくて。\nでも、どんな歌になるのか楽しみにしているわ。", "zh": "只可惜我很快就要去下个工作了。\n不过，我很期待你们会录出怎样的歌曲喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "d330625c3e874c138eea456085e377dae8f5f27396cb86c4e2afda72271f9e25", "ja": "は、はい……あの、ありがとうございますっ！\n私、精いっぱい頑張ります……！", "zh": "好、好的……那个，非常感谢！\n我会全力以赴的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "c0c6e5ea79a9d01f327aeb5e12322b089bde6d69d4255463a2e3f5f98efddc7f", "ja": "ええ、頑張って。……ジュリアは明日、一緒に\n撮影の仕事だったわね。よければ話を聞かせて。", "zh": "嗯，加油……茱莉亚，明天我们有一起摄影的工作吧？\n不介意的话，明天再告诉我结果吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "1682db3ae003e68a6660850bc7aab5f1761913e69511ddd32755e43ad2d834af", "ja": "ああ、なんなら歌も聞かせるぜ。\nへへっ、じゃあ明日な！", "zh": "好啊，要我唱给你听也行喔。\n嘿嘿！那就明天见啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "b3fd5fef7e62975d9c231e472d20b42e2faa93a487bd463e612b348658d1813f", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\nそれじゃ、また。", "zh": "呵呵，不错呢。\n那么，再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "2f28a641162929e2e4de31007e8e01a8965844a09dab4c81d8c70b7ac23cac6e", "ja": "千早さんが……\n期待してくれてるなんて……！", "zh": "千早……\n居然也这么期待……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "b25cf09ac4b6009b10f1546c276f83b4a69c0049d15fbfe20d26faa1608fee4f", "ja": "ますます気合い入れていかないとな。\nよし、はじめようぜ、{$P$}！", "zh": "看来我们得更加把劲了。\n好，开始录吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "eb7659141ff78a326839773822b871239e106fbe774578920364470a4ed02b90", "ja": "（こうして、ふたりのレコーディングが始まった。\nこれまでどおり順調に……と、思っていたのだが……）", "zh": "（两人的录音工作就这样展开。\n本来以为能像之前一样顺利……没想到……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "5bb9c9ca104b3bf482be672e7eb3d221b819a4c27bb000bfbf7aa32f278826ec", "ja": "ストップ！　う～ん……。\nシズ、なんか噛み合ってなくないか？", "zh": "停！嗯……\n静，是不是不太协调啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "941439677a2f1b9e294f45524cb48494bd73d49f6365fd78f833ad97d14207bb", "ja": "きっと私の歌が、ジュリアさんの歌に\n負けてしまってるんですよね。ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "一定是因为我的歌声不足以跟茱莉亚的歌声抗衡。\n对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "f7a99fc87a40e7cf3a519fd48f177078f6a6a06310c5fc4b107a29c766250344", "ja": "いや、シズが謝るようなことじゃない。ウチらは\nデュオなんだ。お互いに合わせていかないとな。", "zh": "不，静，你不需要道歉。\n我们是双人组，本来就必须互相配合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "3e43e7c3efa2cf035457063ff3e297b51f134fc03f6d30c3b12aabfdda5a405c", "ja": "次はもうちょっと、お互いの声を意識してみようぜ。\n……よし、もう一回、頭から！", "zh": "接下来我们再试着稍微注意对方的声音吧。\n……好，从头再录一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "538254ede3a684abebb9c39731d0f79e8bbeb0897b7fb14427e4f1bb949cb92a", "ja": "（しかし次のテイクも、その次のテイクも……）", "zh": "（然而下一个Take、再下一个Take都……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "024941b48cc8ed8e7a0f7f7f758681cb30fc27149d252b173ba978c1e7a14eef", "ja": "{$P$}、\nあんたは今のテイク、どう思った？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n刚刚录的那个Take，你觉得怎样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3a36352f01bdeaf75722b3a9f8e071f1dc7c6a479519ea019a55b01887bc8e52", "ja": "どう思うもなにも……。\nふたりとも、まるで納得してない顔だよな？", "zh": "先别问我……\n从你们的表情看来，一点都不满意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "566c81a2c467067fb4a30544678bc6a90f38df440cefdc80c33d8921e36086e2", "ja": "納得できるわけありません！　私に引きずられて、\nジュリアさんの歌まで弱々しくなって。こんなの……！", "zh": "怎么可能会满意呢！？茱莉亚被我拖累，\n害她也跟着压抑歌声，这样子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "53896cf952ca2f21a61c00a5bb8ebf5e430adeab4511c954d73173c0ef23fba2", "ja": "いや、たぶん逆だ。あたしの歌のアラさが、\nシズのメロディを狂わせちまってる気がする。", "zh": "不，我觉得相反。\n可能是我唱得不够细腻，才会害静的旋律走掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6576ed93c8e0c0d1e6e655dee2811630b933bfebff14f18e78892336f15fa369", "ja": "（どっちも、ってところかな。うーん……）", "zh": "（看来是双方都有影响吧，嗯……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1026_syuurokusutaffu", "source_sha256": "155932bb6119bfecf142ae870a5fd27f5e47c3b1ff6106eeca0fe2d194544b80", "ja": "とりあえず休憩しますか？　今日中に録れなくても、\n帳尻は合わせられますから……。", "zh": "要不要先休息呢？就算今天录不了，\n还是有办法调整的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0579316013693bdc75318b63ab38cc711e9ab281f6d3a3d8baa266e1f36ce895", "ja": "そうですね……。\nよし、ふたりとも。いったん休憩にしよう。", "zh": "说得也是……\n好，你们两个，先休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "bc43a0ed3e56355ce8773c75cf945e03de398ffaccaf2c22eac043e887d153bc", "ja": "ああ／はい……。", "zh": "好。／是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "bc69717254230f2131d72e09b4778c9a5f5f8d730caedd697f3763b628e29a51", "ja": "（……まいったな。ここに来て、ふたりの歌い方が\nさっぱり噛み合わなくなってしまった）", "zh": "（……伤脑筋，到了这个地步，\n她们俩的演唱方式才出现不合。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "e436844d66cd8d07af1e720d31c110df3af91135054834f79195c79d1e8677d8", "ja": "（ピアノの経験に裏打ちされた、静香の美しい歌声と、\nジュリアの、本能からの力強い歌声……）", "zh": "（静香的优美歌声有学习钢琴的经验作为基础，\n而茱莉亚强而有力的歌声则是出自本能……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "edc9c5d57b0a9580b9826c0ccd9968d08a6373f7c7d4bd32a0de8c619d3c39a6", "ja": "（うまく噛み合えば、お互いに補い合ってどこまでも\n伸びていく。けど、ぶつかってしまったら……）", "zh": "（如果双方配合得好，就能形成互补，前途无量。\n但是，要是有所冲突……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "bd0f9c716928731a2e8e1e987ae624997faa4697580b84c535d172050bfa4a64", "ja": "（お互いを削り合って、弱め合ってしまう）", "zh": "（就只会互相磨损、削弱。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "45e316ac96743e93ba19d10c89e84c4ea8db5f2b52a9dea41d6dc8e000cb184f", "ja": "あの……{$P$}。\nレコーディングの時間、延長できませんか？", "zh": "不好意思……{$P$}，\n请问录音的时间有办法延长吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "4448b992cdcea8e22eca8b39a75334c0f3c53ab02cd4fb98f1b80b83ad936d23", "ja": "スタジオには、この後の予定がもう入ってる。\nちょっと……無理かな。", "zh": "这间录音室接下来还有其他人预约。\n应该……不太可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "1232a39e43848fbbd2d54d12567b6ca4f9cbfc3341da6f37ba8208ccb07a9521", "ja": "そうですか……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "1500e034615072d49a1d2fd25f10ea6b2d57d82ac2192d5c2d7bd74ac2e0bb0b", "ja": "それに、仮に延長できたとしても、\nこのまま漠然と続けて良くなるとは思えないんだ。", "zh": "况且，就算能延长好了，\n我也不认为你们继续茫然录下去会有改善。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "e4e89c9b96d25bac59c91db1bad112b0b3c3a3dac7a0aad98e8362f963de62e5", "ja": "すまない、俺の判断ミスだよな。今回の歌、ふたりとも\nしっかりマスターしてくれたと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "抱歉，是我判断错误了。\n这次的歌曲，我以为你们都很熟练了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "fa482aef0846d4456bbb3a77596b5415d012f4e5e6954961fa014c8d67519387", "ja": "ひとつの歌として、まだ噛み合ってなかったんだ。\n『二人の歌』には、なってなかったんだろう。", "zh": "但是还无法完整融合为一首歌。\n我想，这首歌还没成为你们『两人的歌』吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "c3f7673b639a893708d0e9128b45853192b79fc40895c22f623635bb5bfbf8ae", "ja": "『二人の歌』……？", "zh": "『两人的歌』……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "8a9cbfcca3a8e13c02714ede7be3255df01b153a59d09b9bfb972b43da465e21", "ja": "かもな。あたしの歌、シズの歌にはできてた。\nお互いに好きに歌って、気持ちよかったよ。でも……。", "zh": "可能吧，毕竟我和静已经各自掌握这首歌了。\n我们都尽情演唱，非常畅快，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "84561bdc41c2a050c95b390c6183e3a18aa062f8a62f238d73a285234c6877cb", "ja": "それだけじゃダメなんだ。ふたりでどう歌うか……。\nどんなロックにするか、イメージを合わせないと。", "zh": "光是这样还不够，问题在于我们要怎么合唱……\n想呈现怎样的摇滚，我们的想法必须一致才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca7c6d86618041328101030fcfa67cb972b7b71c3a6f8bba60576cbde57f9d7f", "ja": "どんな……ロックに……？", "zh": "怎样的……摇滚……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "62976a741958d18f9046a3e8c7306e8cc3969c815010e2d7f8bb8f7b82ba81fe", "ja": "でもスケジュール的に、録り直しは難しい。\nそれで、さっきスタッフに言われたんだが……。", "zh": "可是从行程来看，应该很难再重录了。\n所以，刚才工作人员跟我说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "08247e4b7be3c04cc8a3bef2d5644ab1fe4af66460353ff836e7332c4608ef54", "ja": "一応、これまでに録ったテイクの中から、合いそうな\nところを摘んでMIXする、という方法もある。", "zh": "还是有办法解决，\n就是从之前录的Take里剪出合适的，再MIX起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "96eb67202b0b4d86d14da50257ea63ebab14182efa63bef5771a2e501150386c", "ja": "そ、それは……。そうでしょうね。\nレコーディングって、そういうものですから。", "zh": "这、这样……想想也是。\n录音本来就是这样进行的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1049_015siz", "source_sha256": "12f245116f89cc3d18ad95031a654cf67e61c0eeedab660c9e1d32a76c634415", "ja": "もちろん、イヤですけど。でもスケジュールが\n動かせないなら、とりあえずは……。", "zh": "我个人当然不想这样，但行程无法挪动的话，\n也只能先……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "7c69e0bf91d2657ea0094ed42a2f727ac19ce5df783e608e8a72ad1caf9801ff", "ja": "冗談じゃない。\n断る、つーかムリだ。", "zh": "别开玩笑了。\n我拒绝，办不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1051_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0ad73e0d3e684a2124d87bf736abd5941d21d5910b11a7575888db75c401234", "ja": "えっ。ジュリアさん？", "zh": "咦，茱莉亚？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "e5d8e67cd5b9a1d9cb7784f3aec36f28a539d6072995f537a63e0037a4552ae2", "ja": "ツギハギするったって、完成形が見えてないんだ。\nどう歌うか決まってないのに、摘みようがないだろ？", "zh": "就算胡乱拼凑起来，也不会完整的。\n我们连怎么唱都还没决定好，要怎么剪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1053_015siz", "source_sha256": "b9dc9bac9cb09b02027725b553d2d29990f934c2d1b364bd99a8576a13fc99eb", "ja": "そ、それは……。", "zh": "这、这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "738cef5551680660908b8f045cf33292c499109922dc32206347deb1153ae92f", "ja": "そうだよな……。よし、これから掛け合って、\n何とかもう1回、収録させてもらう機会を作るよ。", "zh": "说得也是……好，我去交涉看看，\n看能不能再给我们一次录音的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "7677b533b03c2bb1611c8a297e53c1559cb864236b793ebb76cb9fbc8dd78344", "ja": "収録スタッフとスタジオの都合的に、現実的なのは……\n明後日の夜、2、3テイク程度になると思う。", "zh": "就录音人员和录音室的情况来看，比较可行的时程……\n应该会是大后天晚上，录制两、三个Take。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1056_015siz", "source_sha256": "23984d7efb67be4409b9d9aa3230eeea1cd9b1eba0a89949f0ecfb5bce2494c2", "ja": "明後日……って、すぐじゃないですか！？\nそれも2、3テイクだけ？", "zh": "大后天……那、那不就快到了吗！？\n而且只能录两、三个Take？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1057_p", "source_sha256": "d4dd187a834dfa61881aea04a07fb5f01c78a42765d6e0d5db405a0b055ee405", "ja": "そうだよな、時間もチャンスもほとんどない。\nでも……今はこれしか手がなさそうだ。", "zh": "没错，几乎没有时间和机会尝试了。\n不过……现在只能这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "d1f9555a3fd49fc9080e8a24f54f1be9764930f1d52f9c067ee0f3b43602d5fc", "ja": "ジュリア、静香。明後日の夜までに\n『二人の歌』を仕上げてくれないか？", "zh": "茱莉亚、静香，你们能在大后天晚上之前，\n完成你们『两人的歌』吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1059_050jul", "source_sha256": "409b0ebb3a96f2811a2d0e506b2978c8421071365a32b617dee8c72a43ac7e64", "ja": "ああ、やり直せるなら、それで充分だ！\n今度こそ、ふたりでこの歌をモノにしてみせる！", "zh": "好，这段时间足够从头来过了！\n这一次我们一定会一起掌握这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1060_050jul", "source_sha256": "a55874d7e27e8623df858bb842fe8084f7758dfa629889bd69e4a6aa3a23f4ee", "ja": "だよな、シズ？", "zh": "没错吧，静？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1061_015siz", "source_sha256": "2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f", "ja": "…………っ。", "zh": "…………唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1062_050jul", "source_sha256": "bbac6ea2ea07618c7af409245f8ab0c5b1558b9d3a897b57d1ddc0b696ce246c", "ja": "……シズ？", "zh": "……静？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1063_015siz", "source_sha256": "689ed92e85c124cd776c5ea2e6f3d315f8713c2bc0fe31def31f083482002c46", "ja": "私は……できるなんて、軽々しく……言えません。\nだって、本当に時間がないし……。", "zh": "我……无法轻易承诺……说我办得到。\n因为，时间真的非常紧迫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1064_015siz", "source_sha256": "9b79a9baad2bfaeaa8b879b51dccd12323d732ac9a527ec030c841049db38610", "ja": "まだ、どうすればいいかも全然……わからないし。\nそれにジュリアさん、明日……仕事って……。", "zh": "我也还不知道……该怎么调整。\n而且茱莉亚明天……还有其他工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1065_050jul", "source_sha256": "ecdf092ea1681e1a1c218f1ec9ea70727c46c6081489820a4a58045e0b969fd9", "ja": "ああ。でも、シズだって、\nあきらめたくないだろ？", "zh": "是啊。\n可是，静，你应该也不想放弃吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1066_015siz", "source_sha256": "73c75a2a75dbd3dbdd4bd9482f59f3eaa31f7452429921ea772f6108d313c5ba", "ja": "そんなの当たり前じゃないですか！　私だって、\nふたりできちんとこの曲に向き合いたいです！", "zh": "那是当然的啊！\n我也想要两人一起好好面对这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1067_015siz", "source_sha256": "29bb68b507613c024347935cfbebed8e10cafa87cb180ca7d7eda9b716898333", "ja": "でも……。\n私、できるって……思えない……。", "zh": "可是……\n我不认为……自己办得到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1068_050jul", "source_sha256": "7d388d19f98359c9628cb96d6f4a9aa9bb84599329b2118726418263875ec8e3", "ja": "シズ……。", "zh": "静……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1069_p", "source_sha256": "c71fb7eb1a4aba29b732848396e36150bf39a8d8bc95610747a3b9f22287a535", "ja": "……静香、うまくできないならできないでいいんだ。\nただ、もう一回チャンスを作れるってだけで……。", "zh": "……静香，办不到也没有关系。\n现在只是多了一次机会能尝试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1070_015siz", "source_sha256": "b0922809469a74cc4291458bde926ee7c2f6a8cb57ac62aacfe9d9eacaa05bcf", "ja": "あ……、私……。\nあの……す、すみません！", "zh": "啊……我……\n那个……对、对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1071_050jul", "source_sha256": "93ae930f684aaa2d0822652a0f104506c4f8ef49cc0e293ad50209915015d088", "ja": "あっ……おい、シズ！", "zh": "啊……喂，静！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1072_p", "source_sha256": "7fc23acac1bd043bc0e3c9895466ee337a3fd4947c3c9a0645f3acd7fec5d83f", "ja": "（ジュリアと静香の実力に甘えて、任せっきりにして\nしまった俺の落ち度だ。信頼とは別の問題なのに……）", "zh": "（我太仰赖茱莉亚和静香的实力了，不该全丢给她们。\n是我不好，这样子根本算不上信赖……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0062_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_03_1073_p", "source_sha256": "446100308f391523d38a6a4322a12340af5e49bc61bff354d9c5cb573023d696", "ja": "（どうにか『二人の歌』にたどり着いてほしい。\n……誰よりも当人たちが一番、そう思っているはずだ）", "zh": "（希望她们能设法完成『两人的歌』……\n她们本人应该是最希望如此的吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
